<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean military helicopter crashes, two killed.</title>
<headline>S.Korean military helicopter crashes, two killed.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South Korean military helicopter crashed on Thursday, killing two soldiers and injuring two, the defence ministry said.</p>
<p>A ministry spokesman said the helicopter came down in a rural district about 50 km (30 miles) east of Seoul.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
